  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rights-Based Alcohol and Drug Abuse Prevention Among Girls &amp; Young Women</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to empower local communities in changing harmful gender norms and unequal power relations. The project will work with children to ensure they are enjoying their full human rights and communities are reporting Gender Based Violence and advocating for policy changes within their communities. The project will further strengthen the coordination and networking among stakeholders working on gender, health, and drug and alcohol abuse prevention.</narrative>
  </description>
